      "title": "What hiver does",
      "items": [
        "Finds providers: any plugin with a pane named setup",
        "Opens it in your folder with HIVER_SETUP_TASK",
        "swarm launch: own space, addons, agents, schedules",
        "Then runs the swarm: bus, idle delivery, wake-ups"
      ]
